# Files that must not end up in apps/llmchat/ on the server.
# Used via: rsync --exclude-from=.deployignore
#
# The built artefacts in js/ and css/ MUST be transferred — nothing is
# built on the server.

# dependencies and sources — build inputs, useless at runtime
node_modules/
src/
package.json
package-lock.json
vite.config.js

# Never ship a composer/ directory: its presence switches off Nextcloud's
# generic PSR-4 autoloader (AppManager::registerAutoloading), and without a
# vendor/ next to it the app dies with a fatal error.
composer.json
composer.lock
composer/
vendor/

# sourcemaps — 11 of the 14 MB in js/, only useful with src/ present
*.map

# repo noise
.git/
.gitignore
.deployignore
nextcloud-llm-app-spec.md
